<title>AUSTRIA: TABLE-MMK H1 results breakdown by division.</title>
<headline>TABLE-MMK H1 results breakdown by division.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is a breakdown of cartonboard maker Mayr-Melnhof Karton's group results by division for the first six months to June 30, 1997. (Figures in millions of schillings unless stated).</p>
<p>						1997    1996</p>
<p>CARTONBOARD</p>
<p> Sales					3,331   3,393</p>
<p> Operating profit			   346     340</p>
<p> Cash earnings				459     429</p>
<p> Tonnes produced (in thousands)	 508     513</p>
<p> Workforce				  1,957   2,032</p>
<p>PACKAGING</p>
<p> Sales					2,057   1,750</p>
<p> Operating profit			   156	53</p>
<p> Cash earnings				183	95</p>
<p> Tonnes processed (in thousands)	101	88</p>
<p> Workforce				  2,333   2,128</p>
<p>RECYCLING</p>
<p> Sales					  722     806</p>
<p> Operating profit			   nil	41</p>
<p> Cash earnings				 25	66</p>
<p> Tonnes sold (in thousands)	     489     422</p>
<p> Workforce				    581     651</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12256</p>
